{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271540/extras/5d0a75de8548d86570ca2134b50fcb31.avif?t=1772587954\" width=600 height=379 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271540/extras/76d840d13bb0bb0a8260d8c835868ce3.avif?t=1772587954\" width=600 height=379 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271540/extras/884190608d97f8adfb63dcbb65d10546.avif?t=1772587954\" width=600 height=379 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 20 fully original artworks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect kinks and spend them to earn even more kinks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new Waifus by clicking and giving them some love!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and strategize upgrades</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271540/extras/05d02b48bf609459e3396a82c890204d.avif?t=1772587954\" width=616 height=160 /></span>Nany is a passionate card game enthusiast with a particular love for poker. She thrives on the thrill of strategy and outsmarting her opponents. Whether she\u2019s playing a casual game with friends or competing in high-stakes tournaments, Nany approaches every hand with a mix of skill and confidence. Her calm demeanor hides the intense focus she applies to every game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271540/extras/fe45567c3b8b3093092221cf96d7e255.avif?t=1772587954\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph